WEBVTT

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:09.930
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.260
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.270
...crazy about you!

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:44.260
You can get bent!

00:01:44.260 --> 00:01:47.930
How can sound so self-important!?
How can you say "'Let's break up"'!?

00:01:47.930 --> 00:01:50.600
l'm the one who should be saying that!

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:53.930
Toji... Toji...

00:01:53.930 --> 00:01:56.370
l'm breaking up with you!

00:01:57.940 --> 00:01:59.070
Momo-chan! Wait! Momo-chan!

00:01:59.070 --> 00:02:07.010
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV

00:02:14.890 --> 00:02:20.090
"'A Sizzling, Tempestuous Swim Meet"'

00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:24.290
Oh, man, that Momo-chan!

00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:27.390
Throwing an apple at you
while you're sick, Toji...

00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:32.730
Toji?

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:40.970
Momo-chan!

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:41.980
I'm sorry!

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:46.980
It just slipped out in front of Sae-chan
about how I kissed you, Momo-chan!

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:50.510
Let's go back to Toji's room,
and I'll apologize to him for it.

00:02:51.990 --> 00:02:54.650
That's okay.

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:58.330
That's okay! Sae can have him!

00:02:58.330 --> 00:03:01.260
He can go out with Sae, and get
all twisted around her finger...

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:04.090
...until he's all chewed up,
and then gets dumped, for all I care!

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:14.740
"'Nurse's Office"'

00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:15.280
Come on, get up.

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:17.370
Come on, now.

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:21.280
Misao-chan...

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:23.940
Dream on!

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:26.950
Come on, come on, get going.

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:28.290
No, I'll pass...

00:03:28.290 --> 00:03:32.960
What's the matter? You haven't been by
the nurse's office that much lately.

00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:35.630
Misao-chan, what should I do?

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:37.650
I've done something I can't undo.

00:03:39.970 --> 00:03:42.640
Excuse me!

00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:45.310
Doc, do you have a band aid?

00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:46.970
I fell down.

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:48.980
Oh, my, you did a real number there.

00:03:48.980 --> 00:03:51.310
Really lame, huh?

00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:52.980
Be careful, now.

00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:54.310
Thanks.

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:55.650
Momo-chan...

00:03:55.650 --> 00:03:58.990
Oh, Okayasu, what are you doing here?

00:03:58.990 --> 00:04:03.590
Should we go see Toji again today?
We can't just leave it like this.

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:05.020
We have to talk this out.

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:12.600
That's funny! Why would you
be worried about me and Toji?

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:16.940
Doesn't it work out better for you
to have me and Toji broken up?

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:23.610
W- well, sure... But are you okay with it,
Momo-chan? Breaking up like this?

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:27.950
I'm fine with it. I found out just
what kind of person Toji is yesterday.

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:32.620
I didn't think he was such a selfish,
jealous, narrow-minded jerk.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:33.950
It's disenchanting.

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:36.960
It's a big load off, breaking up with him.

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:39.290
Well, I'm off.

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:41.590
Misao-chan, thank you!

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:46.220
Adachi-san really is good and tough.

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:50.640
Huh? Seriously?

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:54.970
Isn't she awful? She chucked an apple
at someone who is sick!

00:04:54.970 --> 00:04:58.980
It re-opened Toji's wound, and he's going
to have to stay in the hospital longer.

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:00.910
Woah, that really torques me off!

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:05.870
Unbelievable. The nerve of her,
pitching a fit like that in the hospital!

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:09.480
Hey...

00:05:29.280 --> 00:05:32.970
Ohh, sorry about that.
My legs are a little long.

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:35.620
Your waxing strips are still in place.

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:38.380
Oh no! You're kidding me!

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:51.730
"'Swim meet contestant selection

00:05:51.730 --> 00:05:52.200
Do we have any candidates?

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:57.970
Who'd want to be a candidate for that?

00:05:57.970 --> 00:06:00.570
l'm not about to get any
darker than l already am.

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:02.240
Yes!

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:05.250
I nominate Adachi-san!

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:09.580
As I remember, Momo-chan, you said you
used to be on the swim team, right?

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:10.580
Why, you...

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:12.590
Yeah, is that right?

00:06:12.590 --> 00:06:13.920
Then, no problem.

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:15.590
That settles that.

00:06:15.590 --> 00:06:19.590
No! Absolutely not! I can't swim!

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:22.930
Momo-chan, you don't
have to be so modest.

00:06:22.930 --> 00:06:25.900
After all, you used to be on the swim team.

00:06:26.270 --> 00:06:28.970
"'Swim Meet List of {articipants"'
"'Boys / Event / Girls"'

00:06:28.970 --> 00:06:31.070
T- this isn't happening, right?

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:33.270
l'm in ten whole races?

00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:36.110
"'Final Exam"'
"'Quiet during the test!"'

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:38.870
Curse you, Sae!

00:06:39.950 --> 00:06:42.480
Curse you, Sae! Curse you, Sae!

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:45.920
Are you a parasite that feeds off
of other people's unhappiness!?

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:50.350
"'1st Semester final test score
comprehensive results table"'
"'1st Year 3rd Class Adachi Momo"'

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:54.890
Abysmal.

00:06:58.630 --> 00:07:00.900
Stop ditching us, Ex-Swim Team.

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:03.390
We've got relay practice, Ex-Swim Team.

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:11.270
l don't want to get suntanned!
What am l supposed to do?

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:16.580
Later, Ex-Swim Team.

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:18.070
See you tomorrow.

00:07:25.930 --> 00:07:28.020
l've had enough.

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:34.270
Momo-chan!

00:07:34.270 --> 00:07:36.270
What happened to your uniform?

00:07:36.270 --> 00:07:38.610
What are you even doing here?

00:07:38.610 --> 00:07:42.280
Oh, you know. I heard you were
having workouts for the swim meet,

00:07:42.280 --> 00:07:45.280
so I figured if I came here, I'd be
able to see some girls in swimsuits!

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:50.620
Is that right?

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:53.950
Sae-chan has the whole rest
of the class on her side, huh?

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:57.290
Why does everyone believe
what Sae tells them?

00:07:57.290 --> 00:08:01.230
Do I really come off as someone that bad?

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:04.230
I do think there are those out
there who understand you, Momo-chan.

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:06.230
Where?

00:08:06.230 --> 00:08:07.670
Me, for instance.

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:11.910
How come you don't say anything?

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:14.840
--I wish you'd say "'You, Kairi?"' or deny it,
--lt's not like l need
a thousand people to understand me;

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:18.910
--or at least jump in
with something else again.
--l'd be fine with just one-

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:21.920
l wanted Toji to understand me.

00:08:21.920 --> 00:08:24.250
You're recovering nicely.

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:27.150
At this rate, you'll be able
to go home in two more days.

00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:33.590
What's this, Adachi,
you're sitting out today, too?

00:08:33.590 --> 00:08:36.060
Sorry, I don't feel too well.

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:42.600
No matter what anyone says, l don't want
to tan any more than l already have!

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:44.940
l should put on some more sunblock.

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:45.610
Huh?

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:48.270
lt's not here! lt's not here!
lt's not here!

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:50.270
My sunblock isn't here!

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:53.280
Oh, here it is.

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:56.950
Thank goodness!
Toji said it didn't bother him,

00:08:56.950 --> 00:09:00.680
but it's a given that boys want their
girlfriends to be lighter than they are.

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:06.890
What am l doing? l don't have
to worry about this anymore.

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:20.310
Come to think of it,
back in middle school,

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:23.970
l always used to watch Toji practicing
through the fence like this.

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:35.150
H- here it comes!

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:37.920
Oops! Wild throw!

00:09:41.590 --> 00:09:42.890
Thank you very much!

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:51.270
You know, Momo,
don't feel bad when I tell you this,

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:54.940
but I heard that Toji doesn't
like girls with darker skin.

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:58.880
That's right. That's the reason
why l started buying it.

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:04.620
l'm such a dummy. l don't
have to worry about being tan.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:05.950
Not now that l've broken up with Toji.

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:07.620
Huh!?

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:09.760
Done with practice already?

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:13.120
Tch, missed out on seeing
girls in swimsuits again!

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:16.630
Okayasu...

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:19.230
You don't have to wait all that time
until practice is over

00:10:19.230 --> 00:10:21.970
and then come see how I'm doing.

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:24.640
W- whatever do you mean?

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:26.740
You're worried that it will
start up more rumors

00:10:26.740 --> 00:10:30.310
if you talk to me in front of others, right?

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:32.650
I can tell that much, you know.

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:35.420
I mean, today,
when our eyes met in the hall,

00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:37.320
you took off out of there, right?

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:39.650
It was pretty blatant.

00:10:39.650 --> 00:10:41.050
I'm fine with it.

00:10:41.050 --> 00:10:45.320
It's nearly summer vacation, and they
say that rumors only last for 15 days.

00:10:45.320 --> 00:10:47.260
lt's 75 days...

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:52.000
I know, Momo-chan! How about
taking a trip over summer vacation?

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:54.670
To the same ocean where we first met!

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:59.340
Or, maybe not. Momo-chan,
you don't want to tan, and all.

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:00.940
Maybe I will go...

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:02.610
R- really!?

00:11:02.610 --> 00:11:04.610
But not with you, Okayasu.

00:11:04.610 --> 00:11:07.280
O- oh, no...

00:11:07.280 --> 00:11:08.280
Let's go!

00:11:08.280 --> 00:11:10.620
You dummy. Well, I'll think about it.

00:11:10.620 --> 00:11:12.290
Uh-huh, think about it, think about it!

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:13.620
Momo?

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:15.020
If it isn't Momo!

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:17.620
Kyo-chin?

00:11:17.620 --> 00:11:19.960
Wow, it's been so long!

00:11:19.960 --> 00:11:23.300
l heard that Toji doesn't
like girls with darker skin.

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:24.630
You doing okay?

00:11:24.630 --> 00:11:25.970
Mm-hmm.

00:11:25.970 --> 00:11:28.970
So, is this guy your boyfriend?
He's so handsome!

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:31.640
Huh? Yeah, well, his looks, at least.

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:34.640
Looks like you're totally enjoying
your life in high school, aren't you?

00:11:34.640 --> 00:11:36.640
I was worried over nothing!

00:11:36.640 --> 00:11:37.640
Worried?

00:11:37.640 --> 00:11:41.650
I was sure that you were still
carrying a torch for Toji, Momo,

00:11:41.650 --> 00:11:44.980
so when I saw you, I was
going to apologize to you.

00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:48.990
Remember, when you said to go
ask Toji what kind of girl he liked,

00:11:48.990 --> 00:11:51.990
and I told you that he didn't
like girls with darker skin, right?

00:11:51.990 --> 00:11:53.660
Mm-hmm.

00:11:53.660 --> 00:11:55.890
Actually, that was a lie.

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:58.330
A lie?

00:11:58.330 --> 00:12:02.270
The truth is, the type of girl
that Toji likes is active and cheerful.

00:12:02.270 --> 00:12:06.940
Back then, I was in love
with Toji, too. But then,

00:12:06.940 --> 00:12:10.080
as a result, you wound up coming
across this handsome boyfriend,

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:11.940
so you'll forgive me, right?

00:12:11.940 --> 00:12:14.950
Aah! Oh, no! I'm supposed
to meet my boyfriend!

00:12:14.950 --> 00:12:19.620
He's not as handsome as your boyfriend,
Momo, but he's madly in love with me.

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:20.850
Bye!

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:34.630
M- Momo-chan...

00:12:34.630 --> 00:12:37.970
Did you hear what she just said?
That was horrible!

00:12:37.970 --> 00:12:40.010
She said she was going to help me,

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:41.970
so I opened up to her
about how I felt about Toji.

00:12:41.970 --> 00:12:45.650
I really am a girl without any friends.

00:12:45.650 --> 00:12:48.270
Aah, seriously...

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:53.320
Momo-chan...

00:12:53.320 --> 00:12:55.310
l'm breaking up with you, Toji!

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:01.930
Why?

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:05.260
Why... did I...

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:07.790
...say such a thing!?

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:31.620
How did things turn out like this?

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:34.960
l wanted Toji to get mad
right along with me.

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:36.130
l just wanted him to comfort me,

00:13:36.130 --> 00:13:40.970
saying ''You poor girl,
having such a hard time of it.''

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:46.640
But Toji never once sought to believe me.

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:51.310
l still love you, Toji. Even now,
my feelings haven't changed.

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:56.150
But l can't undo what
has been done. Farewell.

00:14:09.260 --> 00:14:11.200
They said they're going
to throw a karaoke party

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:12.600
for whichever class wins the swim meet!

00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:13.930
On the other hand, whoever comes in last...

00:14:13.930 --> 00:14:15.940
...has to do weekly supplementary classes
during summer vacation.

00:14:15.940 --> 00:14:17.270
You're kidding!

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:20.270
Of all days, it had to be clear today...

00:14:20.270 --> 00:14:23.580
Wow, that sunlight is so strong!

00:14:23.580 --> 00:14:26.610
You'd darken up in a second out here
if you had to swim, huh?

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:28.940
Well, sunblock, sunblock...

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:36.620
You bet l'm going to swim! All-out!
l'm not about to let Sae control my life!

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:39.290
Adachi used to be on the swim team, right?

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:41.790
That means that our class
won't come in last, anyway.

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:43.630
We might even win, you know.

00:14:43.630 --> 00:14:45.860
If we do, we get some
lavish year-end party, huh?

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:52.310
Oh, no! lf she really does win...

00:14:52.310 --> 00:14:55.100
l can't let her become
more prominent than l am!

00:14:57.310 --> 00:14:59.850
Say there! You guys
are competing too, right?

00:14:59.850 --> 00:15:01.970
Can I ask you to do me a favor?

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:09.260
Ah, this sensation sure takes me back.

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:11.960
lt reminds me of when
l was in middle school,

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:13.930
when l swam day in and day out.

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:16.600
The practices were hard,
but l did have my friends.

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:19.430
Swimming was so much fun,
l couldn't help myself.

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:22.590
Watch out! Watch out!

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:31.240
What? Can't breathe!

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:40.290
What did you do that for!?

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:42.310
Sorry! Sorry!

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:48.850
l mean, really...

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:55.030
Ogawa-san? Ogawa-san!

00:15:55.970 --> 00:15:58.640
Are you okay? Swallowed any water?

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:00.570
Thank goodness.

00:16:00.570 --> 00:16:03.370
You should go to the nurse's office
and get checked out.

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:07.580
--Kako!
--What happened?

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:12.640
My, my, why does fate always take me
to people who are drowning?

00:16:14.920 --> 00:16:16.260
So, did it go well?

00:16:16.260 --> 00:16:18.590
We got a tear started... I think.

00:16:18.590 --> 00:16:23.260
What were you doing!? I told you to
cut the shoulder strap of her swimsuit!

00:16:23.260 --> 00:16:24.560
Not only did you fail to do that,

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:26.600
but what good does it do to
have her have to rescue you!?

00:16:26.600 --> 00:16:27.930
Good grief...

00:16:27.930 --> 00:16:30.490
Sae-chan! Come on over here!

00:16:33.940 --> 00:16:35.940
What was that? How galling!

00:16:35.940 --> 00:16:37.640
We only let her into our group

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:39.280
because she said she was
being picked on by Adachi.

00:16:39.280 --> 00:16:41.800
Now she's coming off like she's our queen!

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:44.380
Ready!

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:52.960
You'll really go on a date with me?

00:16:52.960 --> 00:16:57.300
Okay, okay! For you, Emi-chan,
I'd go anywhere.

00:16:57.300 --> 00:16:59.630
Kairi!

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:00.900
What are you doing with her?

00:17:00.900 --> 00:17:02.570
What do you mean, "'date"'?

00:17:02.570 --> 00:17:05.910
Oh, just arranging
my summer vacation schedule.

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:09.910
Chinatsu-chan, about what
I called you up yesterday for...

00:17:09.910 --> 00:17:11.910
You're really okay with dating me?

00:17:11.910 --> 00:17:13.250
Kairi!

00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:17.980
How can he be off flirting like it
was nothing, when l'm facing a crisis?

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:19.250
Take your marks!

00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:22.250
What am l so agitated about?

00:17:22.250 --> 00:17:24.450
He's just being the same
old Okayasu as always, isn't he?

00:17:26.260 --> 00:17:29.600
l'm just about to start swimming here!
How about cheering for me?

00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:31.930
That's right, don't even give me a glance.

00:17:31.930 --> 00:17:33.600
Ready!

00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:36.270
ldiot! Skirt-chaser! Heartless jerk!

00:17:36.270 --> 00:17:39.170
And after he said ''Momo-chan,
l'm the only friend you've got,'' too!

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:45.280
Aw, man! l don't know why,
but it pisses me off!

00:17:45.280 --> 00:17:46.280
Awesome!

00:17:46.280 --> 00:17:47.970
Adachi is incredibly fast, Adachi!

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:01.890
Huh?

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:03.560
Why did she stop swimming?

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:04.900
Ah! She's getting passed!

00:18:04.900 --> 00:18:07.870
Hey, you were almost there!
Swim through to the end!

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:27.250
What am l going to do?
l've got nine more races to go.

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:30.260
That must have been when it happened.

00:18:30.260 --> 00:18:32.260
What will l do?

00:18:32.260 --> 00:18:34.590
Girls 50m breaststroke!

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:37.260
Hey, Adachi! What were
you doing in that last race!?

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:39.600
Dive in, Ex-Swim Team!

00:18:39.600 --> 00:18:42.600
Take it seriously! You want us
to have supplementary courses!?

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:45.970
l've taken what temporary measure
l could, but if l dive in, it will rip.

00:18:50.280 --> 00:18:52.950
lt's no use. l'm too worried
about my shoulder strap.

00:18:52.950 --> 00:18:54.280
What are you doing!?

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:56.540
Get it together! Get it together!

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:05.890
So, let's go out on a date.

00:19:05.890 --> 00:19:07.560
You'd really do that?

00:19:07.560 --> 00:19:12.790
Okay, okay! Let's see,
I've got Sumire-chan on the 4th...

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:16.570
Sorry about that.

00:19:16.570 --> 00:19:17.930
Hey there.

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:20.240
Toji!

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:24.580
You're out of the hospital.
That's terrific.

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:26.640
Is your scar all healed up?

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:32.590
I've got something good to show you.

00:19:32.590 --> 00:19:33.920
You dumbass!

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:35.250
You screw-up!

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:36.920
You call yourself an
ex-swim team member!?

00:19:40.930 --> 00:19:44.930
Right now, Momo-chan has been
shunned by the rest of the class.

00:19:44.930 --> 00:19:48.270
Why Adachi? What's happened
while I've been away?

00:19:48.270 --> 00:19:50.600
It's because of Sae-chan.

00:19:50.600 --> 00:19:51.940
Whoa...

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:55.270
Don't go telling me that Sae-chan
wouldn't do something like that.

00:19:55.270 --> 00:19:58.280
Though I guess it's no use trying
to tell you anything right now, Toji.

00:19:58.280 --> 00:20:00.770
You're completely
under her control, after all.

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:08.290
Come to that place we were
before in 30 minutes.

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:10.620
I'll have something
even more amazing to show you.

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:13.820
But you have to make
sure nobody sees you.

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:21.630
lt's starting to run where it's frayed.

00:20:21.630 --> 00:20:23.900
And l've got seven more races!

00:20:26.310 --> 00:20:30.710
What am l doing? l've been
shunned by the rest of the class,

00:20:30.710 --> 00:20:33.310
and l'm getting this kind of harassment.

00:20:33.310 --> 00:20:37.540
Aah, it's all gone so bad so quickly...

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:42.320
With things like this,
maybe l should just go away somewhere.

00:20:42.320 --> 00:20:43.980
Drop out of school...

00:20:44.990 --> 00:20:47.480
Adachi-san... Um...

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:50.220
W- what!?

00:20:52.670 --> 00:20:54.000
Um...

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:58.000
Here! All the races
that I'm in are now over!

00:20:58.000 --> 00:20:59.730
Thank you for earlier.

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:19.260
All right! Let's do this!

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:32.640
--Get out of here, you idiot!
--No, stop!

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:36.980
Wait! Hold on! I need a favor
from you, Momo-chan!

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:38.310
A favor?

00:21:38.310 --> 00:21:41.980
It's kind of something I can't
ask in front of other people.

00:21:41.980 --> 00:21:43.810
What is it?

00:21:45.650 --> 00:21:47.650
Let me hug you.

00:21:47.650 --> 00:21:48.990
W-

00:21:48.990 --> 00:21:52.660
What are you, an idiot!?
There's no way I'd let you-

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:58.330
Hey, keep back! If you come
any closer, I'm gonna slug you!

00:21:58.330 --> 00:22:00.700
Stay away! Stay away! Stay away!

00:22:18.950 --> 00:22:20.750
Okayasu...

00:22:36.420 --> 00:22:42.430
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:42.430 --> 00:22:52.110
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.110 --> 00:22:55.110
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.110 --> 00:23:01.720
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:01.720 --> 00:23:08.050
Where can we go

00:23:08.050 --> 00:23:17.730
where we can all be

00:23:17.730 --> 00:23:21.000
under the same sky?

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:29.410
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.410 --> 00:23:35.420
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:35.420 --> 00:23:41.760
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:41.760 --> 00:23:49.100
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.100 --> 00:23:57.030
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:00.710 --> 00:24:06.380
You don't know anything about
Okayasu! Okayasu has many good points!

00:24:06.380 --> 00:24:09.380
He's a much better person
than you are, at least!

00:24:09.380 --> 00:24:13.380
Next time on {each Girl,
"'Clash! Sudden Death of Love"'
